commit 0492597089e41464d9e8669e20969688618a5be3
Author: Daiki Ueno <dueno@redhat.com>
Date:   2023-03-02

    rpc-server: Check pointer value returned by proto_read_byte_array
    
    The commit b58b725f30ea833ce8ff08879f616b32be44cbdb added a case where
    proto_read_byte_array may return non-zero length while the pointer
    location is set to NULL.  This is to accommodate the change in
    rpc_C_Initialize.
    
    Spotted by oss-fuzz:
    https://bugs.chromium.org/p/oss-fuzz/issues/detail?id=56504
    
    Signed-off-by: Daiki Ueno <dueno@redhat.com>

 p11-kit/rpc-server.c | 3 ++-
