commit 8fd7fc528dd83521d5fec7f8261789cac9d65ea8
Author: Clemens Lang <cllang@redhat.com>
Date:   2023-02-01

    rpc: Fix two off-by-one errors identified by asan
    
    Reads after the end of the array happen when removing elements as well
    as if the last element was removed. Note that the new if is required
    because memmove() expects a size_t as length, so we must ensure that it
    can not be negative.
    
